WEBVTT

00:00:01.761 --> 00:00:05.697
Browsers remember your tabs. They do not remember your intent.

00:00:05.697 --> 00:00:09.633
For someone with attention or working memory difficulties, a small

00:00:09.633 --> 00:00:13.568
interruption can mean starting an entire task again. Hold My

00:00:13.568 --> 00:00:17.504
Place is a private browser extension that leaves one clear

00:00:17.504 --> 00:00:19.472
next step for your return.

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:24.884
Here is the working prototype. This is a practice licence

00:00:24.884 --> 00:00:28.280
renewal, with five steps and made up details. I complete

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.676
my details and address, then reach the photo step. The

00:00:31.676 --> 00:00:34.392
application stays in my browser. Nothing is submitted.

00:00:36.398 --> 00:00:39.794
Now an interruption arrives. I hold my place, then step

00:00:39.794 --> 00:00:43.190
away. When I return, there is a short reminder: complete

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:46.586
the photo. Continue takes me straight to the field and

00:00:46.586 --> 00:00:49.982
highlights it. There is less to reconstruct, and no pressure

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:50.661
to hurry.

00:00:52.662 --> 00:00:57.162
The capture is visible. It records labels and whether fields

00:00:57.162 --> 00:01:01.662
are filled, never the answers I typed. A personal note

00:01:01.662 --> 00:01:06.163
can replace an unhelpful cue. Read aloud is optional. If

00:01:06.163 --> 00:01:10.663
I am finished, Forget everything removes the saved place. Control

00:01:10.663 --> 00:01:12.463
stays with the person.

00:01:14.469 --> 00:01:18.591
Cloudflare Workers hosts the demo and an optional AI endpoint.

00:01:18.591 --> 00:01:22.713
Before an AI request, you can inspect the exact metadata

00:01:22.713 --> 00:01:26.835
that will be sent. Workers AI turns that structure into

00:01:26.835 --> 00:01:30.957
a short cue. If the service fails, the local rule

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:35.080
based cue remains available. No cloud database stores your places.

00:01:37.089 --> 00:01:40.888
This is also a real Chrome and Edge extension. On

00:01:40.888 --> 00:01:44.686
ordinary websites, use Alt H or the toolbar button. The

00:01:44.686 --> 00:01:48.485
return banner offers Continue and Done. The places list lets

00:01:48.485 --> 00:01:52.284
you inspect the capture, edit a note, and delete it.

00:01:52.284 --> 00:01:55.322
Captures expire after twenty four hours by default.

00:01:57.333 --> 00:02:01.548
Settings offer text, spoken cues, and configurable expiry. Cloud AI

00:02:01.548 --> 00:02:05.763
is off by default. Sensitive page detection blocks likely banking,

00:02:05.763 --> 00:02:09.977
health and payment pages from using AI. A focused submit

00:02:09.977 --> 00:02:14.192
or pay button produces a check first warning. These safeguards

00:02:14.192 --> 00:02:18.407
help, but cannot guarantee that every page or AI cue

00:02:18.407 --> 00:02:19.250
is correct.

00:02:21.257 --> 00:02:25.657
Hold My Place is a solo project for the accessibility

00:02:25.657 --> 00:02:30.057
and disability inclusion track. This example evaluation uses clearly labeled

00:02:30.057 --> 00:02:34.457
synthetic data, not real participants. It illustrates how we will

00:02:34.457 --> 00:02:38.856
measure completion, time to resume, effort, and cue accuracy. Real

00:02:38.856 --> 00:02:43.256
participant validation is next. A pause should not mean starting

00:02:43.256 --> 00:02:43.696
over.

